WEBVTT

00:08:57.032 --> 00:09:02.121
we’ve been studying and detecting galaxies
millions of light-years away

00:09:02.121 --> 00:09:03.289
for a long time.

00:09:03.581 --> 00:09:05.749
And both of these have caused us,

00:09:05.749 --> 00:09:06.750
for example,

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.378
to transform industries like medicine,

00:09:09.378 --> 00:09:10.421
farming,

00:09:10.421 --> 00:09:11.547
astrophysics

00:09:11.547 --> 00:09:12.548
and much more.

00:09:13.048 --> 00:09:15.759
So when we talk about computer vision,

00:09:15.759 --> 00:09:16.760
when it started,

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:18.804
it was really a thought experiment

00:09:18.804 --> 00:09:23.851
to see if we could replicate
what humans see using cameras.

00:09:24.268 --> 00:09:27.438
It has now graduated with sensors,

00:09:27.438 --> 00:09:28.439
computers,

00:09:28.439 --> 00:09:29.440
AI

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.191
and software innovation